{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Preserve the released plugin ordering contract.** Existing configurations document hooks as running in registration order, while this reverses every invocation-end hook. A patch upgrade can therefore expose plugins to another plugin's MDC, thread-local state, or resources in an incompatible lifecycle phase. Keep registration order, or introduce an explicit/versioned LIFO opt-in with compatibility coverage.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc771Cti","finding_digest":"6a6a364423079980f182e8d5380ffe41cbf54169c4fd16e9b84450553a2a3bdc","finding_id":"arf_v1_njvdmrbda6myb4mc5dktqd76ih","finding_key":"sdk/pluginrunner::oninvocationend::registration-order-compatibility","identity_key":"sdk/pluginrunner::oninvocationend::registration-order-compatibility","line":110,"observation_digest":"dee850e82d56885f08801a5b315162be553e6c68c20559e6b534518b3b47260a","observation_id":"aro_v1_33ufb2bnk2ef6ceadjntculcxz","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/plugin/PluginRunner.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_njvdmrbda6myb4mc5dktqd76ih","published_at":"2026-10-08T22:58:16Z","review_id":"arr_v1_qp2s77wcifot6fsjerbxqgi4ds","reviewed_base_sha":"0c8618e42d3b16e9b7115ab943a93253c0fe936c","reviewed_head_sha":"6794136501d52a1dd2c79ea3ff5b7081b995aaa1","reviewer":"codex","start_line":110,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":771},"record_id":"art_v1_wdemeb6qixhw27nvsbie46cg4q","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-08T22:58:16Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
